   "author_url": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/user/97183/fiodor",
   "created_at": "2026-05-25T08:01:03+00:00",
   "body_html": "<!--[if BLOCK]><![endif]-->            <p>When you press V in game you can mount your gun on surfaces, this mod makes you able to mount your gun on your team mates. So if you want to snipe a target 500m ahead while on a mountain you can use your team mate as a support to reduce weapon sway and recoil.</p>\n\n        <!--[if ENDBLOCK]><![endif]-->",
